 114:Core/Src/main.c ****  * transfer-complete callback, which is also where the FIFO tail advances. The
 115:Core/Src/main.c ****  * slot must stay untouched until then, since the DMA is reading straight out
 116:Core/Src/main.c ****  * of it. */
 117:Core/Src/main.c **** static volatile uint8_t  stream_tx_busy = 0;
