 683:Core/Src/main.c **** /** Range-check happens here, on the way in -- Execute_HCA_Control stays a pure
 684:Core/Src/main.c ****  *  hot path and just uses whatever value is standing.
 685:Core/Src/main.c ****  *  @return the value actually applied, which is the request clamped to range.
